# Normalize everything to LF in the repository and check it out as LF on
# every platform, Windows included.
#
# This is not a style preference. `spec/fixtures/` holds byte-exact golden
# files that the project codec is compared against, and Git's default
# `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows rewrites them to CRLF on checkout — so
# `spec_worked_example_matches_the_committed_fixture` fails on a fresh clone
# for a reason that has nothing to do with the format. Rust, Cargo and every
# editor this project uses read LF on Windows without complaint.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.bin binary
*.gltf -text
